# Waking the Colossus' 306 at the blank lamp (a Progress, Prog 2 with the Lightning Cell) against Path of Darkness' 6
# (ToAU 42 current, status 0; a Progress): the two tie, the mission's first, so the first talk plays 6 and the next
# rotates to 306. An Event in place of 306 would lose both. The lamp loads hidden: shown by a GM. 6's finish on option
# 1 changes nothing.
lists AlzadaalUnderseaRuins/blank_lamp/onTrigger
char zone=AlzadaalUnderseaRuins pos=208.05,-1.5,20.05 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=1
quest AhtUrhgan.WakingTheColossus accepted
keyitem LightningCell
charvar Quest[6][74]Prog 2
mission Toau PathOfDarkness current
login
npcstatus blank_lamp normal             # a GM: shown
trigger blank_lamp                      # 6 and 306 tie: the mission's first
finish option=1
trigger blank_lamp                      # rotated: 306 (Prog 3)
finish
